 "method_note": "The official day page for an archived date renders the fixture (both teams, a game id, the word FINAL) and prints '-' in every score, record and leader cell. The same page for a recent date prints the score. That asymmetry is the reason 23 games of this season cannot be graded from official pages: the results exist, the page this repository is allowed to read does not show them. The fixtures are therefore used to repair the SCHEDULE layer and never to supply a score.",
